notes = "This spatial recipe delegates its body visual to canonical GroundSurface spatial_effect.material.electrified_water, which consumes the actual same spatial UUID, observed geometry/cells, suppression and lifetime. The former ability-side source is retained here only as inactive source provenance; no second condition or fixed-review field is drawn. Existing independent responses and metadata remain unchanged. Current source optical/shape/cost limits remain in the delivery handoff; this assignment is unvalidated and all artwork remains unreviewed."
